    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A spacious four bedroom detached home that offers plenty of adaptable living space and a splendid landscaped garden to enjoy. This nicely laid out property was built in 2007 and extends to c.204 sq. meters of living accommodation comprising of an Entrance Hall, Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, Utility Room, 4 Bedrooms, One En-suite and Two Bathrooms. \n\nOutside there is driveway to the front with post and rail fencing, front and rear gardens in lawn with mature trees and shrubs and a mature hedge line boundary. \nThe property has double glazed uPVC windows, Oil fired central heating, mains water and septic tank. \n\nThis quiet, rural location is ideal being a very convenient c.8 km from Ballybrophy Train Station with it`s excellent commuter links and just c.4.2 km from the M7 Dublin/Limerick Motorway. All local amenities are within easy reach with Errill village just c.3km away and the town of Rathdowney just c.4km. \n\nViewing of this excellent property is highly recommended.\n\nEntrance Porch - 3.2m (10'6) x 2.55m (8'4)\nWood flooring.\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.6m (18'4) x 5m (16'5)\nWood flooring\n\nKitchen - 5.5m (18'1) x 2.76m (9'1)\nTiled flooring. Quality fitted kitchen. Electric hob and oven.\n\nDining Room - 3.9m (12'10) x 3.55m (11'8)\nTiled flooring. Patio door to rear garden.\n\nLiving Room - 6.25m (20'6) x 4.5m (14'9)\nCarpet flooring. Cut stone fireplace.\n\nUtility - 2.77m (9'1) x 1.95m (6'5)\nTiled flooring. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Hot water cylinder.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m (14'1) x 3.5m (11'6)\nWood flooring.\n\nEn-suite - 2.3m (7'7) x 1.6m (5'3)\nFully tiled. Power shower. W.C. W.H.B.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m (7'10) x 2.3m (7'7)\nFully tiled. Bath. W.C.W.H.B\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.8m (19'0) x 3m (9'10)\nWood flooring\n\n1st Floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 6.1m (20'0) x 4.7m (15'5)\nCarpet flooring. Roof windows.\n\nBathroom - 2m (6'7) x 2.25m (7'5)\nLino floor covering. Power shower unit. W.C. W.H.B. with vanity unit.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.7m (15'5) x 6m (19'8)\nCarpet flooring. Roof window.\n\nLanding - 4m (13'1) x 3m (9'10)\nCarpet flooring. Roof window.\n\n\nwhat3words /// decode.vocations.inputs\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
